{"skill":{"slug":"deep-research-cellcog","displayName":"Deep Research"},"version":{"version":"1.0.20","createdAt":1787536863393,"changelog":"Content updated.","changelogSource":"user","license":"MIT-0","files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":8185,"sha256":"2254081d9ba2296d070e1b9c88a19eefe8727db44d79941f697d3050838704c7","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":2460,"sha256":"c481821c087ee5d6299b605933632d78484dd36346d8e73588d3a3e2c2b70ca4","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789032104708,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"2b7a14dddf2921e6072e8fc520261d621ee1ce14b178b2e3507a977765c29152","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/2b7a14dddf2921e6072e8fc520261d621ee1ce14b178b2e3507a977765c29152","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":null,"normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":null,"source":"engines","checkedAt":1787537708268},"skillspector":{"status":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","score":18,"severity":"LOW","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":2,"checkedAt":1789032104708},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"This is a coherent CellCog deep-research skill with external-service and install-supply-chain risks that users should understand, but no evidence of hidden, destructive, or deceptive behavior.","dimensions":[{"detail":"The stated requirements are limited to python3, a CELLCOG_API_KEY, and the CellCog dependency, which are proportionate for a hosted research integration.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The artifact recommends mutable install commands such as npx skills add, openclaw skills install, and pip install -U without pinning a reviewed version.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"note"},{"detail":"Prompts are explicitly passed to CellCog create_chat calls, but the skill does not prominently warn users that sensitive task content may be sent to a third-party service.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"note"},{"detail":"No local scripts, persistence hooks, privilege escalation steps, background services, destructive actions, or credential-harvesting instructions were found in the reviewed artifact.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The skill's instructions, examples, API key requirement, and CellCog SDK use align with its stated purpose of running external AI research tasks.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"ok"}],"guidance":"Install only if you trust CellCog as a third-party research provider. Treat prompts, uploaded context, and generated research requests as data shared with CellCog, avoid sending secrets or regulated data unless approved, and prefer pinned package versions or reviewed release sources where possible.","findings":"[SQP-2] expected: External prompt submission is inherent to using a hosted CellCog research service, but clearer privacy and sensitive-data guidance would improve user awareness.\n[RP1] unexpected: The unpinned npx skill installation is a real supply-chain caution, but it is user-initiated install guidance rather than hidden runtime behavior.\n[T08] unexpected: The unpinned cellcog dependency and pip upgrade guidance create mutable dependency risk; no artifact evidence shows the current dependency is malicious.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789032104708}}}}}